{
 "duration": 625.725,
 "sample_rate": 48000,
 "beats": [
  {
   "id": "b001",
   "speaker": "NARRATOR",
   "chapter": "cold_open",
   "start": 0.35,
   "end": 6.86,
   "text": "The sky tears open over the final battlefield. Red light, black light, and a whole world holding its breath.",
   "voice_id": "e686ae649ee44f219a108aacba206c1a",
   "role": "NARRATOR",
   "duration_ms": 6510,
   "pause_ms": 295,
   "start_ms": 350,
   "end_ms": 6860
  },
  {
   "id": "b002",
   "speaker": "LIEBE",
   "chapter": "cold_open",
   "start": 7.155,
   "end": 10.17,
   "text": "Asta! Wake up! Asta!",
   "voice_id": "e225bbe5f57e4498bea0b99cc83b7e82",
   "role": "LIEBE",
   "duration_ms": 3015,
   "pause_ms": 202,
   "start_ms": 7155,
   "end_ms": 10170
  },
  {
   "id": "b003",
   "speaker": "NARRATOR",
   "chapter": "cold_open",
   "start": 10.372,
   "end": 21.022,
   "text": "Asta falls, and the world goes silent. Then church bells. Cold sheets. Small, trembling hands. Same bed, same church, same cracked ceiling.",
   "voice_id": "e686ae649ee44f219a108aacba206c1a",
   "role": "NARRATOR",
   "duration_ms": 10650,
   "pause_ms": 277,
   "start_ms": 10372,
   "end_ms": 21022
  },
  {
   "id": "b006",
   "speaker": "NARRATOR",
   "chapter": "cold_open",
   "start": 21.299,
   "end": 26.709,
   "text": "Asta was never supposed to have magic. He was supposed to wait fifteen years in the dirt for a miracle.",
   "voice_id": "e686ae649ee44f219a108aacba206c1a",
   "role": "NARRATOR",
   "duration_ms": 5410,
   "pause_ms": 289,
   "start_ms": 21299,
   "end_ms": 26709
  },
  {
   "id": "b009",
   "speaker": "NARRATOR",
   "chapter": "cold_open",
   "start": 26.998,
   "end": 34.013,
   "text": "What if he remembered everything? The Spade raid. The betrayals. Every name, every face, every grave.",
   "voice_id": "e686ae649ee44f219a108aacba206c1a",
   "role": "NARRATOR",
   "duration_ms": 7015,
   "pause_ms": 286,
   "start_ms": 26998,
   "end_ms": 34013
  },
  {
   "id": "b011",
   "speaker": "NARRATOR",
   "chapter": "cold_open",
   "start": 34.299,
   "end": 39.919,
   "text": "And the brother sealed inside the wall of Hage's tower. All of it, in the head of a six year old boy.",
   "voice_id": "e686ae649ee44f219a108aacba206c1a",
   "role": "NARRATOR",
   "duration_ms": 5620,
   "pause_ms": 670,
   "start_ms": 34299,
   "end_ms": 39919
  },
  {
   "id": "b013",
   "speaker": "NARRATOR",
   "chapter": "ch1",
   "start": 43.789,
   "end": 54.809,
   "text": "The wind in Hage comes down off the demon skull, and nobody ever thinks twice about it. Asta thinks about nothing else. He stands at the church fence, eyes closed, and feels the air lean.",
   "voice_id": "e686ae649ee44f219a108aacba206c1a",
   "role": "NARRATOR",
   "duration_ms": 11020,
   "pause_ms": 272,
   "start_ms": 43789,
   "end_ms": 54809
  },
  {
   "id": "b015",
   "speaker": "NARRATOR",
   "chapter": "ch1",
   "start": 55.081,
   "end": 61.196,
   "text": "Ki. The breath and the heartbeat of the world. A body with no magic can still learn to hear it.",
   "voice_id": "e686ae649ee44f219a108aacba206c1a",
   "role": "NARRATOR",
   "duration_ms": 6115,
   "pause_ms": 260,
   "start_ms": 55081,
   "end_ms": 61196
  },
  {
   "id": "b016",
   "speaker": "NARRATOR",
   "chapter": "ch1",
   "start": 61.456,
   "end": 68.416,
   "text": "The air shifts. Three seconds later, Yuno's gust slams the laundry line, and every sheet snaps.",
   "voice_id": "e686ae649ee44f219a108aacba206c1a",
   "role": "NARRATOR",
   "duration_ms": 6960,
   "pause_ms": 263,
   "start_ms": 61456,
   "end_ms": 68416
  },
  {
   "id": "b017",
   "speaker": "YUNO",
   "chapter": "ch1",
   "start": 68.679,
   "end": 73.084,
   "text": "Hey. You looked at the sheets before my wind even moved. How?",
   "voice_id": "f13afbd2a0e348b9b4b3154e2a9515e9",
   "role": "YUNO_CHILD",
   "duration_ms": 4405,
   "pause_ms": 206,
   "start_ms": 68679,
   "end_ms": 73084
  },
  {
   "id": "b018",
   "speaker": "ASTA",
   "chapter": "ch1",
   "start": 73.29,
   "end": 74.955,
   "text": "Heh. Lucky guess.",
   "voice_id": "829184c635314c9485e48690116ff8ad",
   "role": "ASTA_CHILD",
   "duration_ms": 1665,
   "pause_ms": 186,
   "start_ms": 73290,
   "end_ms": 74955
  },
  {
   "id": "b019",
   "speaker": "NARRATOR",
   "chapter": "ch1",
   "start": 75.141,
   "end": 81.966,
   "text": "Yuno is six, and still a crybaby. Last time, Asta mocked him for it. This time, he hands him a handkerchief.",
   "voice_id": "e686ae649ee44f219a108aacba206c1a",
   "role": "NARRATOR",
   "duration_ms": 6825,
   "pause_ms": 317,
   "start_ms": 75141,
   "end_ms": 81966
  },
  {
   "id": "b020",
   "speaker": "YUNO",
   "chapter": "ch1",
   "start": 82.283,
   "end": 86.579,
   "text": "I wasn't crying! It was the wind, okay?",
   "voice_id": "f13afbd2a0e348b9b4b3154e2a9515e9",
   "role": "YUNO_CHILD",
   "duration_ms": 4296,
   "pause_ms": 219,
   "start_ms": 82283,
   "end_ms": 86579
  },
  {
   "id": "b021",
   "speaker": "ASTA",
   "chapter": "ch1",
   "start": 86.798,
   "end": 89.143,
   "text": "Sure it was. Totally the wind.",
   "voice_id": "829184c635314c9485e48690116ff8ad",
   "role": "ASTA_CHILD",
   "duration_ms": 2345,
   "pause_ms": 166,
   "start_ms": 86798,
   "end_ms": 89143
  },
  {
   "id": "b022",
   "speaker": "YUNO",
   "chapter": "ch1",
   "start": 89.309,
   "end": 93.505,
   "text": "Why are you being nice to me? It's weird. What do you want?",
   "voice_id": "f13afbd2a0e348b9b4b3154e2a9515e9",
   "role": "YUNO_CHILD",
   "duration_ms": 4196,
   "pause_ms": 163,
   "start_ms": 89309,
   "end_ms": 93505
  },
  {
   "id": "b023",
   "speaker": "ASTA",
   "chapter": "ch1",
   "start": 93.668,
   "end": 95.123,
   "text": "Call it an investment.",
   "voice_id": "829184c635314c9485e48690116ff8ad",
   "role": "ASTA_CHILD",
   "duration_ms": 1455,
   "pause_ms": 293,
   "start_ms": 93668,
   "end_ms": 95123
  },
  {
   "id": "b024",
   "speaker": "NARRATOR",
   "chapter": "ch1",
   "start": 95.416,
   "end": 105.006,
   "text": "It confuses everyone. The loudest kid in Hage has gone quiet, and he watches everything. Then Sister Lily crosses the yard, and an old habit wakes up on its own.",
   "voice_id": "e686ae649ee44f219a108aacba206c1a",
   "role": "NARRATOR",
   "duration_ms": 9590,
   "pause_ms": 306,
   "start_ms": 95416,
   "end_ms": 105006
  },
  {
   "id": "b026",
   "speaker": "ASTA",
   "chapter": "ch1",
   "start": 105.312,
   "end": 107.537,
   "text": "Sister Lily, marry me!",
   "voice_id": "829184c635314c9485e48690116ff8ad",
   "role": "ASTA_CHILD",
   "duration_ms": 2225,
   "pause_ms": 176,
   "start_ms": 105312,
   "end_ms": 107537
  },
  {
   "id": "b027",
   "speaker": "SISTER_LILY",
   "chapter": "ch1",
   "start": 107.713,
   "end": 109.658,
   "text": "Oh, Asta. You know the rule.",
   "voice_id": "7b0e224b87454737a05e573d318e89ba",
   "role": "SISTER_LILY",
   "duration_ms": 1945,
   "pause_ms": 184,
   "start_ms": 107713,
   "end_ms": 109658
  },
  {
   "id": "b028",
   "speaker": "NARRATOR",
   "chapter": "ch1",
   "start": 109.842,
   "end": 115.442,
   "text": "He feels her weight shift a heartbeat early. And for the first time in history, Asta steps aside.",
   "voice_id": "e686ae649ee44f219a108aacba206c1a",
   "role": "NARRATOR",
   "duration_ms": 5600,
   "pause_ms": 315,
   "start_ms": 109842,
   "end_ms": 115442
  },
  {
   "id": "b029",
   "speaker": "FATHER_ORSI",
   "chapter": "ch1",
   "start": 115.757,
   "end": 119.362,
   "text": "It missed! Lily's fist missed! That's never happened!",
   "voice_id": "1d304964fcfe4c5998cfe7b7298aa727",
   "role": "FATHER_ORSI",
   "duration_ms": 3605,
   "pause_ms": 180,
   "start_ms": 115757,
   "end_ms": 119362
  },
  {
   "id": "b030",
   "speaker": "SISTER_LILY",
   "chapter": "ch1",
   "start": 119.542,
   "end": 122.735,
   "text": "Oh my. Asta, you're growing up so fast.",
   "voice_id": "7b0e224b87454737a05e573d318e89ba",
   "role": "SISTER_LILY",
   "duration_ms": 3193,
   "pause_ms": 268,
   "start_ms": 119542,
   "end_ms": 122735
  },
  {
   "id": "b031",
   "speaker": "NARRATOR",
   "chapter": "ch1",
   "start": 123.003,
   "end": 134.183,
   "text": "At seven, Asta asks Yuno for a blindfold, then tells him to throw everything he has. Wind blades. Pebbles. A gust meant to knock him flat. He slips between them like smoke.",
   "voice_id": "e686ae649ee44f219a108aacba206c1a",
   "role": "NARRATOR",
   "duration_ms": 11180,
   "pause_ms": 339,
   "start_ms": 123003,
   "end_ms": 134183
  },
  {
   "id": "b033",
   "speaker": "YUNO",
   "chapter": "ch1",
   "start": 134.522,
   "end": 135.971,
   "text": "How did you know?",
   "voice_id": "f13afbd2a0e348b9b4b3154e2a9515e9",
   "role": "YUNO_CHILD",
   "duration_ms": 1449,
   "pause_ms": 210,
   "start_ms": 134522,
   "end_ms": 135971
  },
  {
   "id": "b034",
   "speaker": "ASTA",
   "chapter": "ch1",
   "start": 136.181,
   "end": 139.816,
   "text": "Throw harder. You breathe in right before you cast.",
   "voice_id": "829184c635314c9485e48690116ff8ad",
   "role": "ASTA_CHILD",
   "duration_ms": 3635,
   "pause_ms": 339,
   "start_ms": 136181,
   "end_ms": 139816
  },
  {
   "id": "b036",
   "speaker": "NARRATOR",
   "chapter": "ch1",
   "start": 140.155,
   "end": 145.725,
   "text": "Yuno goes very still. He isn't used to being the one who's behind. And he hates how it feels.",
   "voice_id": "e686ae649ee44f219a108aacba206c1a",
   "role": "NARRATOR",
   "duration_ms": 5570,
   "pause_ms": 328,
   "start_ms": 140155,
   "end_ms": 145725
  },
  {
   "id": "b037",
   "speaker": "YUNO",
   "chapter": "ch1",
   "start": 146.053,
   "end": 149.726,
   "text": "Then I'll learn not to. I'll be Wizard King first, you'll see.",
   "voice_id": "f13afbd2a0e348b9b4b3154e2a9515e9",
   "role": "YUNO_CHILD",
   "duration_ms": 3673,
   "pause_ms": 173,
   "start_ms": 146053,
   "end_ms": 149726
  },
  {
   "id": "b038",
   "speaker": "ASTA",
   "chapter": "ch1",
   "start": 149.899,
   "end": 152.704,
   "text": "Try it. I'm still beating you there, Yuno.",
   "voice_id": "829184c635314c9485e48690116ff8ad",
   "role": "ASTA_CHILD",
   "duration_ms": 2805,
   "pause_ms": 268,
   "start_ms": 149899,
   "end_ms": 152704
  },
  {
   "id": "b039",
   "speaker": "NARRATOR",
   "chapter": "ch1",
   "start": 152.972,
   "end": 160.702,
   "text": "Season after season, he trains the only thing nobody can take from him. And every night, he climbs to the roof and looks at the grimoire tower.",
   "voice_id": "e686ae649ee44f219a108aacba206c1a",
   "role": "NARRATOR",
   "duration_ms": 7730,
   "pause_ms": 324,
   "start_ms": 152972,
   "end_ms": 160702
  },
  {
   "id": "b041",
   "speaker": "NARRATOR",
   "chapter": "ch1",
   "start": 161.026,
   "end": 165.861,
   "text": "Because he knows what is sleeping in its wall. And he knows exactly how long it has been waiting.",
   "voice_id": "e686ae649ee44f219a108aacba206c1a",
   "role": "NARRATOR",
   "duration_ms": 4835,
   "pause_ms": 677,
   "start_ms": 161026,
   "end_ms": 165861
  },
  {
   "id": "b042",
   "speaker": "NARRATOR",
   "chapter": "ch2",
   "start": 169.738,
   "end": 180.338,
   "text": "Age ten. Midnight. The grimoire tower is empty, and Asta knows which stone to press. He follows the draft, cold and thin, to a crack in the wall.",
   "voice_id": "e686ae649ee44f219a108aacba206c1a",
   "role": "NARRATOR",
   "duration_ms": 10600,
   "pause_ms": 268,
   "start_ms": 169738,
   "end_ms": 180338
  },
  {
   "id": "b044",
   "speaker": "NARRATOR",
   "chapter": "ch2",
   "start": 180.606,
   "end": 187.186,
   "text": "Behind the cracked stone lies a filthy, tattered book. Five leaves. He's waited four years to touch it.",
   "voice_id": "e686ae649ee44f219a108aacba206c1a",
   "role": "NARRATOR",
   "duration_ms": 6580,
   "pause_ms": 301,
   "start_ms": 180606,
   "end_ms": 187186
  },
  {
   "id": "b045",
   "speaker": "NARRATOR",
   "chapter": "ch2",
   "start": 187.487,
   "end": 197.112,
   "text": "His fingers close on the cover, and the tower vanishes. Black water. No floor, no sky. Something vast turns over in the dark, and it's hungry.",
   "voice_id": "e686ae649ee44f219a108aacba206c1a",
   "role": "NARRATOR",
   "duration_ms": 9625,
   "pause_ms": 292,
   "start_ms": 187487,
   "end_ms": 197112
  },
  {
   "id": "b047",
   "speaker": "NARRATOR",
   "chapter": "ch2",
   "start": 197.404,
   "end": 202.024,
   "text": "Chains of old black light hang from nowhere, and every single one of them is aimed at him.",
   "voice_id": "e686ae649ee44f219a108aacba206c1a",
   "role": "NARRATOR",
   "duration_ms": 4620,
   "pause_ms": 304,
   "start_ms": 197404,
   "end_ms": 202024
  },
  {
   "id": "b048",
   "speaker": "LIEBE",
   "chapter": "ch2",
   "start": 202.328,
   "end": 207.998,
   "text": "A magicless brat, walking right into my mouth. How convenient.",
   "voice_id": "e225bbe5f57e4498bea0b99cc83b7e82",
   "role": "LIEBE",
   "duration_ms": 5670,
   "pause_ms": 199,
   "start_ms": 202328,
   "end_ms": 207998
  },
  {
   "id": "b049",
   "speaker": "LIEBE",
   "chapter": "ch2",
   "start": 208.197,
   "end": 214.217,
   "text": "Devils hate humans. I hate you most. I'll be wearing you by morning.",
   "voice_id": "e225bbe5f57e4498bea0b99cc83b7e82",
   "role": "LIEBE",
   "duration_ms": 6020,
   "pause_ms": 319,
   "start_ms": 208197,
   "end_ms": 214217
  },
  {
   "id": "b050",
   "speaker": "NARRATOR",
   "chapter": "ch2",
   "start": 214.536,
   "end": 219.461,
   "text": "Asta doesn't raise a hand. He just looks up, the way you look at someone you've missed for years.",
   "voice_id": "e686ae649ee44f219a108aacba206c1a",
   "role": "NARRATOR",
   "duration_ms": 4925,
   "pause_ms": 329,
   "start_ms": 214536,
   "end_ms": 219461
  },
  {
   "id": "b051",
   "speaker": "LIEBE",
   "chapter": "ch2",
   "start": 219.79,
   "end": 222.56,
   "text": "Why aren't you scared, boy?",
   "voice_id": "e225bbe5f57e4498bea0b99cc83b7e82",
   "role": "LIEBE",
   "duration_ms": 2770,
   "pause_ms": 198,
   "start_ms": 219790,
   "end_ms": 222560
  },
  {
   "id": "b052",
   "speaker": "ASTA",
   "chapter": "ch2",
   "start": 222.758,
   "end": 223.868,
   "text": "Your name is Liebe.",
   "voice_id": "829184c635314c9485e48690116ff8ad",
   "role": "ASTA_CHILD",
   "duration_ms": 1110,
   "pause_ms": 307,
   "start_ms": 222758,
   "end_ms": 223868
  },
  {
   "id": "b053",
   "speaker": "LIEBE",
   "chapter": "ch2",
   "start": 224.175,
   "end": 228.13,
   "text": "Who told you that? Nobody knows that name.",
   "voice_id": "e225bbe5f57e4498bea0b99cc83b7e82",
   "role": "LIEBE",
   "duration_ms": 3955,
   "pause_ms": 166,
   "start_ms": 224175,
   "end_ms": 228130
  },
  {
   "id": "b054",
   "speaker": "ASTA",
   "chapter": "ch2",
   "start": 228.296,
   "end": 231.956,
   "text": "Your mother named you. Her name was Licita.",
   "voice_id": "829184c635314c9485e48690116ff8ad",
   "role": "ASTA_CHILD",
   "duration_ms": 3660,
   "pause_ms": 202,
   "start_ms": 228296,
   "end_ms": 231956
  },
  {
   "id": "b055",
   "speaker": "LIEBE",
   "chapter": "ch2",
   "start": 232.158,
   "end": 234.873,
   "text": "Don't. Don't say that name.",
   "voice_id": "e225bbe5f57e4498bea0b99cc83b7e82",
   "role": "LIEBE",
   "duration_ms": 2715,
   "pause_ms": 218,
   "start_ms": 232158,
   "end_ms": 234873
  },
  {
   "id": "b056",
   "speaker": "ASTA",
   "chapter": "ch2",
   "start": 235.091,
   "end": 238.301,
   "text": "Licita. She held you until the very end.",
   "voice_id": "829184c635314c9485e48690116ff8ad",
   "role": "ASTA_CHILD",
   "duration_ms": 3210,
   "pause_ms": 195,
   "start_ms": 235091,
   "end_ms": 238301
  },
  {
   "id": "b057",
   "speaker": "LIEBE",
   "chapter": "ch2",
   "start": 238.496,
   "end": 239.856,
   "text": "I said don't!",
   "voice_id": "e225bbe5f57e4498bea0b99cc83b7e82",
   "role": "LIEBE",
   "duration_ms": 1360,
   "pause_ms": 211,
   "start_ms": 238496,
   "end_ms": 239856
  },
  {
   "id": "b058",
   "speaker": "NARRATOR",
   "chapter": "ch2",
   "start": 240.067,
   "end": 245.547,
   "text": "The dark shudders. Claws that were closing stop, trembling, an inch from his face.",
   "voice_id": "e686ae649ee44f219a108aacba206c1a",
   "role": "NARRATOR",
   "duration_ms": 5480,
   "pause_ms": 334,
   "start_ms": 240067,
   "end_ms": 245547
  },
  {
   "id": "b059",
   "speaker": "LIEBE",
   "chapter": "ch2",
   "start": 245.881,
   "end": 251.751,
   "text": "She died. She sealed me in this filth and died. What do you know?",
   "voice_id": "e225bbe5f57e4498bea0b99cc83b7e82",
   "role": "LIEBE",
   "duration_ms": 5870,
   "pause_ms": 193,
   "start_ms": 245881,
   "end_ms": 251751
  },
  {
   "id": "b060",
   "speaker": "ASTA",
   "chapter": "ch2",
   "start": 251.944,
   "end": 255.089,
   "text": "That she chose you. Every single time.",
   "voice_id": "829184c635314c9485e48690116ff8ad",
   "role": "ASTA_CHILD",
   "duration_ms": 3145,
   "pause_ms": 720,
   "start_ms": 251944,
   "end_ms": 255089
  },
  {
   "id": "b061",
   "speaker": "NARRATOR",
   "chapter": "ch2",
   "start": 255.809,
   "end": 261.199,
   "text": "Nothing. For a long time, only the sound of something enormous trying not to breathe.",
   "voice_id": "e686ae649ee44f219a108aacba206c1a",
   "role": "NARRATOR",
   "duration_ms": 5390,
   "pause_ms": 262,
   "start_ms": 255809,
   "end_ms": 261199
  },
  {
   "id": "b062",
   "speaker": "ASTA",
   "chapter": "ch2",
   "start": 261.461,
   "end": 262.856,
   "text": "She was my mother too.",
   "voice_id": "829184c635314c9485e48690116ff8ad",
   "role": "ASTA_CHILD",
   "duration_ms": 1395,
   "pause_ms": 260,
   "start_ms": 261461,
   "end_ms": 262856
  },
  {
   "id": "b063",
   "speaker": "LIEBE",
   "chapter": "ch2",
   "start": 263.116,
   "end": 265.561,
   "text": "No. That's not possible.",
   "voice_id": "e225bbe5f57e4498bea0b99cc83b7e82",
   "role": "LIEBE",
   "duration_ms": 2445,
   "pause_ms": 190,
   "start_ms": 263116,
   "end_ms": 265561
  },
  {
   "id": "b064",
   "speaker": "ASTA",
   "chapter": "ch2",
   "start": 265.751,
   "end": 268.691,
   "text": "She left me at a church door so I'd live.",
   "voice_id": "829184c635314c9485e48690116ff8ad",
   "role": "ASTA_CHILD",
   "duration_ms": 2940,
   "pause_ms": 321,
   "start_ms": 265751,
   "end_ms": 268691
  },
  {
   "id": "b065",
   "speaker": "LIEBE",
   "chapter": "ch2",
   "start": 269.012,
   "end": 270.409,
   "text": "Who are you?",
   "voice_id": "e225bbe5f57e4498bea0b99cc83b7e82",
   "role": "LIEBE",
   "duration_ms": 1397,
   "pause_ms": 336,
   "start_ms": 269012,
   "end_ms": 270409
  },
  {
   "id": "b066",
   "speaker": "ASTA",
   "chapter": "ch2",
   "start": 270.745,
   "end": 273.015,
   "text": "Your brother. And I'm late.",
   "voice_id": "829184c635314c9485e48690116ff8ad",
   "role": "ASTA_CHILD",
   "duration_ms": 2270,
   "pause_ms": 745,
   "start_ms": 270745,
   "end_ms": 273015
  },
  {
   "id": "b067",
   "speaker": "ASTA",
   "chapter": "ch2",
   "start": 273.76,
   "end": 276.76,
   "text": "Last time, I was fifteen years late.",
   "voice_id": "829184c635314c9485e48690116ff8ad",
   "role": "ASTA_CHILD",
   "duration_ms": 3000,
   "pause_ms": 310,
   "start_ms": 273760,
   "end_ms": 276760
  },
  {
   "id": "b068",
   "speaker": "LIEBE",
   "chapter": "ch2",
   "start": 277.07,
   "end": 280.09,
   "text": "Last time? What does that mean?",
   "voice_id": "e225bbe5f57e4498bea0b99cc83b7e82",
   "role": "LIEBE",
   "duration_ms": 3020,
   "pause_ms": 176,
   "start_ms": 277070,
   "end_ms": 280090
  },
  {
   "id": "b069",
   "speaker": "ASTA",
   "chapter": "ch2",
   "start": 280.266,
   "end": 282.956,
   "text": "Later. First, let me sit down.",
   "voice_id": "829184c635314c9485e48690116ff8ad",
   "role": "ASTA_CHILD",
   "duration_ms": 2690,
   "pause_ms": 191,
   "start_ms": 280266,
   "end_ms": 282956
  },
  {
   "id": "b070",
   "speaker": "LIEBE",
   "chapter": "ch2",
   "start": 283.147,
   "end": 284.927,
   "text": "What do you want from me?",
   "voice_id": "e225bbe5f57e4498bea0b99cc83b7e82",
   "role": "LIEBE",
   "duration_ms": 1780,
   "pause_ms": 168,
   "start_ms": 283147,
   "end_ms": 284927
  },
  {
   "id": "b071",
   "speaker": "ASTA",
   "chapter": "ch2",
   "start": 285.095,
   "end": 287.825,
   "text": "Just to sit here a minute. With my brother.",
   "voice_id": "829184c635314c9485e48690116ff8ad",
   "role": "ASTA_CHILD",
   "duration_ms": 2730,
   "pause_ms": 289,
   "start_ms": 285095,
   "end_ms": 287825
  },
  {
   "id": "b072",
   "speaker": "LIEBE",
   "chapter": "ch2",
   "start": 288.114,
   "end": 291.229,
   "text": "Tch. You're the dumbest human I've ever met.",
   "voice_id": "e225bbe5f57e4498bea0b99cc83b7e82",
   "role": "LIEBE",
   "duration_ms": 3115,
   "pause_ms": 165,
   "start_ms": 288114,
   "end_ms": 291229
  },
  {
   "id": "b073",
   "speaker": "ASTA",
   "chapter": "ch2",
   "start": 291.394,
   "end": 293.494,
   "text": "Probably. I've been told.",
   "voice_id": "829184c635314c9485e48690116ff8ad",
   "role": "ASTA_CHILD",
   "duration_ms": 2100,
   "pause_ms": 260,
   "start_ms": 291394,
   "end_ms": 293494
  },
  {
   "id": "b074",
   "speaker": "NARRATOR",
   "chapter": "ch2",
   "start": 293.754,
   "end": 306.539,
   "text": "Outside, the dawn bell rolls over Hage. Asta climbs out of the tower with dust on his hands and no fear at all. Behind him, in the wall, a devil lies still. Not trapped. Waiting.",
   "voice_id": "e686ae649ee44f219a108aacba206c1a",
   "role": "NARRATOR",
   "duration_ms": 12785,
   "pause_ms": 304,
   "start_ms": 293754,
   "end_ms": 306539
  },
  {
   "id": "b076",
   "speaker": "NARRATOR",
   "chapter": "ch3",
   "start": 310.043,
   "end": 320.083,
   "text": "Five years. By day, Ki footwork until his legs shake. By night, he sits against the tower wall and talks. About bread. About Yuno. About the sky.",
   "voice_id": "e686ae649ee44f219a108aacba206c1a",
   "role": "NARRATOR",
   "duration_ms": 10040,
   "pause_ms": 338,
   "start_ms": 310043,
   "end_ms": 320083
  },
  {
   "id": "b078",
   "speaker": "ASTA",
   "chapter": "ch3",
   "start": 320.421,
   "end": 323.736,
   "text": "Today Yuno tried to cut a tree. The tree won.",
   "voice_id": "9dabfe7b1fb54a24bded803a7b1ff5b4",
   "role": "ASTA",
   "duration_ms": 3315,
   "pause_ms": 179,
   "start_ms": 320421,
   "end_ms": 323736
  },
  {
   "id": "b079",
   "speaker": "LIEBE",
   "chapter": "ch3",
   "start": 323.915,
   "end": 328.97,
   "text": "You're boring me to death, human. Bread? Seriously, bread?",
   "voice_id": "e225bbe5f57e4498bea0b99cc83b7e82",
   "role": "LIEBE",
   "duration_ms": 5055,
   "pause_ms": 199,
   "start_ms": 323915,
   "end_ms": 328970
  },
  {
   "id": "b080",
   "speaker": "ASTA",
   "chapter": "ch3",
   "start": 329.169,
   "end": 330.609,
   "text": "Then why do you keep answering?",
   "voice_id": "9dabfe7b1fb54a24bded803a7b1ff5b4",
   "role": "ASTA",
   "duration_ms": 1440,
   "pause_ms": 200,
   "start_ms": 329169,
   "end_ms": 330609
  },
  {
   "id": "b081",
   "speaker": "LIEBE",
   "chapter": "ch3",
   "start": 330.809,
   "end": 334.334,
   "text": "I'm stuck in a book. Echoes are all I get.",
   "voice_id": "e225bbe5f57e4498bea0b99cc83b7e82",
   "role": "LIEBE",
   "duration_ms": 3525,
   "pause_ms": 270,
   "start_ms": 330809,
   "end_ms": 334334
  },
  {
   "id": "b082",
   "speaker": "NARRATOR",
   "chapter": "ch3",
   "start": 334.604,
   "end": 340.884,
   "text": "The book won't open before the ceremony. So Asta waits, again. But this time, he isn't waiting alone.",
   "voice_id": "e686ae649ee44f219a108aacba206c1a",
   "role": "NARRATOR",
   "duration_ms": 6280,
   "pause_ms": 325,
   "start_ms": 334604,
   "end_ms": 340884
  },
  {
   "id": "b083",
   "speaker": "LIEBE",
   "chapter": "ch3",
   "start": 341.209,
   "end": 346.029,
   "text": "Make the contract. Master and servant. That's how it works.",
   "voice_id": "e225bbe5f57e4498bea0b99cc83b7e82",
   "role": "LIEBE",
   "duration_ms": 4820,
   "pause_ms": 215,
   "start_ms": 341209,
   "end_ms": 346029
  },
  {
   "id": "b084",
   "speaker": "ASTA",
   "chapter": "ch3",
   "start": 346.244,
   "end": 348.794,
   "text": "No. Equals, or nothing.",
   "voice_id": "9dabfe7b1fb54a24bded803a7b1ff5b4",
   "role": "ASTA",
   "duration_ms": 2550,
   "pause_ms": 209,
   "start_ms": 346244,
   "end_ms": 348794
  },
  {
   "id": "b085",
   "speaker": "LIEBE",
   "chapter": "ch3",
   "start": 349.003,
   "end": 353.904,
   "text": "Tch. Fine. Equals. Whatever. Like I care.",
   "voice_id": "e225bbe5f57e4498bea0b99cc83b7e82",
   "role": "LIEBE",
   "duration_ms": 4901,
   "pause_ms": 292,
   "start_ms": 349003,
   "end_ms": 353904
  },
  {
   "id": "b086",
   "speaker": "NARRATOR",
   "chapter": "ch3",
   "start": 354.196,
   "end": 361.526,
   "text": "Fifteen. The tower hall is packed with trembling children. Yuno steps forward, and a four-leaf grimoire answers him.",
   "voice_id": "e686ae649ee44f219a108aacba206c1a",
   "role": "NARRATOR",
   "duration_ms": 7330,
   "pause_ms": 309,
   "start_ms": 354196,
   "end_ms": 361526
  },
  {
   "id": "b087",
   "speaker": "NARRATOR",
   "chapter": "ch3",
   "start": 361.835,
   "end": 368.515,
   "text": "Then it's Asta's turn. Nothing. No light, no book. Only laughter, rolling across the hall.",
   "voice_id": "e686ae649ee44f219a108aacba206c1a",
   "role": "NARRATOR",
   "duration_ms": 6680,
   "pause_ms": 335,
   "start_ms": 361835,
   "end_ms": 368515
  },
  {
   "id": "b088",
   "speaker": "LIEBE",
   "chapter": "ch3",
   "start": 368.85,
   "end": 371.695,
   "text": "They're laughing at you. Doesn't that bother you?",
   "voice_id": "e225bbe5f57e4498bea0b99cc83b7e82",
   "role": "LIEBE",
   "duration_ms": 2845,
   "pause_ms": 218,
   "start_ms": 368850,
   "end_ms": 371695
  },
  {
   "id": "b089",
   "speaker": "ASTA",
   "chapter": "ch3",
   "start": 371.913,
   "end": 374.638,
   "text": "Not anymore. I know how this ends.",
   "voice_id": "9dabfe7b1fb54a24bded803a7b1ff5b4",
   "role": "ASTA",
   "duration_ms": 2725,
   "pause_ms": 340,
   "start_ms": 371913,
   "end_ms": 374638
  },
  {
   "id": "b090",
   "speaker": "NARRATOR",
   "chapter": "ch3",
   "start": 374.978,
   "end": 386.553,
   "text": "Exactly as before, down to the last giggle. And this time, Asta smiles. On the road home, Revchi steps out of the trees, chains hissing at his wrists. He wants Yuno's grimoire.",
   "voice_id": "e686ae649ee44f219a108aacba206c1a",
   "role": "NARRATOR",
   "duration_ms": 11575,
   "pause_ms": 279,
   "start_ms": 374978,
   "end_ms": 386553
  },
  {
   "id": "b092",
   "speaker": "NARRATOR",
   "chapter": "ch3",
   "start": 386.832,
   "end": 391.792,
   "text": "He doesn't notice the magicless boy who's already standing behind him. Nobody ever does.",
   "voice_id": "e686ae649ee44f219a108aacba206c1a",
   "role": "NARRATOR",
   "duration_ms": 4960,
   "pause_ms": 285,
   "start_ms": 386832,
   "end_ms": 391792
  },
  {
   "id": "b093",
   "speaker": "ASTA",
   "chapter": "ch3",
   "start": 392.077,
   "end": 397.042,
   "text": "Revchi. Chain Magic. Thrown out of the Purple Orcas in disgrace.",
   "voice_id": "9dabfe7b1fb54a24bded803a7b1ff5b4",
   "role": "ASTA",
   "duration_ms": 4965,
   "pause_ms": 165,
   "start_ms": 392077,
   "end_ms": 397042
  },
  {
   "id": "b094",
   "speaker": "REVCHI",
   "chapter": "ch3",
   "start": 397.207,
   "end": 400.254,
   "text": "Magicless trash like you has no right to—",
   "voice_id": "661a8165c3fa4d92a910de75aa6bfc51",
   "role": "REVCHI",
   "duration_ms": 3047,
   "pause_ms": 219,
   "start_ms": 397207,
   "end_ms": 400254
  },
  {
   "id": "b095",
   "speaker": "ASTA",
   "chapter": "ch3",
   "start": 400.473,
   "end": 401.298,
   "text": "Skip it.",
   "voice_id": "9dabfe7b1fb54a24bded803a7b1ff5b4",
   "role": "ASTA",
   "duration_ms": 825,
   "pause_ms": 273,
   "start_ms": 400473,
   "end_ms": 401298
  },
  {
   "id": "b096",
   "speaker": "NARRATOR",
   "chapter": "ch3",
   "start": 401.571,
   "end": 411.651,
   "text": "Behind them the tower groans. A crack tears up the wall, and the stone gives way. The five-leaf grimoire rips itself free and tears across the sky, straight for his hand.",
   "voice_id": "e686ae649ee44f219a108aacba206c1a",
   "role": "NARRATOR",
   "duration_ms": 10080,
   "pause_ms": 329,
   "start_ms": 401571,
   "end_ms": 411651
  },
  {
   "id": "b098",
   "speaker": "LIEBE",
   "chapter": "ch3",
   "start": 411.98,
   "end": 416.094,
   "text": "Hurry up, partner. I'm getting bored over here.",
   "voice_id": "e225bbe5f57e4498bea0b99cc83b7e82",
   "role": "LIEBE",
   "duration_ms": 4114,
   "pause_ms": 198,
   "start_ms": 411980,
   "end_ms": 416094
  },
  {
   "id": "b099",
   "speaker": "NARRATOR",
   "chapter": "ch3",
   "start": 416.292,
   "end": 423.697,
   "text": "The Demon-Slayer Sword drops into his hand. One swing. Revchi's chains don't break. They simply stop existing.",
   "voice_id": "e686ae649ee44f219a108aacba206c1a",
   "role": "NARRATOR",
   "duration_ms": 7405,
   "pause_ms": 325,
   "start_ms": 416292,
   "end_ms": 423697
  },
  {
   "id": "b144",
   "speaker": "LIEBE",
   "chapter": "ch3",
   "start": 424.022,
   "end": 427.367,
   "text": "Ha! Now that's what I'm talking about.",
   "voice_id": "e225bbe5f57e4498bea0b99cc83b7e82",
   "role": "LIEBE",
   "duration_ms": 3345,
   "pause_ms": 160,
   "start_ms": 424022,
   "end_ms": 427367
  },
  {
   "id": "b101",
   "speaker": "REVCHI",
   "chapter": "ch3",
   "start": 427.527,
   "end": 430.852,
   "text": "My chains! What did you do to my chains?",
   "voice_id": "661a8165c3fa4d92a910de75aa6bfc51",
   "role": "REVCHI",
   "duration_ms": 3325,
   "pause_ms": 193,
   "start_ms": 427527,
   "end_ms": 430852
  },
  {
   "id": "b102",
   "speaker": "YUNO",
   "chapter": "ch3",
   "start": 431.045,
   "end": 433.25,
   "text": "You've been hiding something since we were six.",
   "voice_id": "b24024afe64444dda6bc35b086ddd7ca",
   "role": "YUNO",
   "duration_ms": 2205,
   "pause_ms": 166,
   "start_ms": 431045,
   "end_ms": 433250
  },
  {
   "id": "b103",
   "speaker": "ASTA",
   "chapter": "ch3",
   "start": 433.416,
   "end": 434.771,
   "text": "Only a few things.",
   "voice_id": "9dabfe7b1fb54a24bded803a7b1ff5b4",
   "role": "ASTA",
   "duration_ms": 1355,
   "pause_ms": 165,
   "start_ms": 433416,
   "end_ms": 434771
  },
  {
   "id": "b104",
   "speaker": "YUNO",
   "chapter": "ch3",
   "start": 434.936,
   "end": 438.396,
   "text": "Fine. Keep your secrets. Just leave me an enemy next time.",
   "voice_id": "b24024afe64444dda6bc35b086ddd7ca",
   "role": "YUNO",
   "duration_ms": 3460,
   "pause_ms": 201,
   "start_ms": 434936,
   "end_ms": 438396
  },
  {
   "id": "b105",
   "speaker": "ASTA",
   "chapter": "ch3",
   "start": 438.597,
   "end": 440.362,
   "text": "Then be faster, Yuno.",
   "voice_id": "9dabfe7b1fb54a24bded803a7b1ff5b4",
   "role": "ASTA",
   "duration_ms": 1765,
   "pause_ms": 196,
   "start_ms": 438597,
   "end_ms": 440362
  },
  {
   "id": "b106",
   "speaker": "YUNO",
   "chapter": "ch3",
   "start": 440.558,
   "end": 442.243,
   "text": "Hmph. I was letting you have it.",
   "voice_id": "b24024afe64444dda6bc35b086ddd7ca",
   "role": "YUNO",
   "duration_ms": 1685,
   "pause_ms": 282,
   "start_ms": 440558,
   "end_ms": 442243
  },
  {
   "id": "b107",
   "speaker": "NARRATOR",
   "chapter": "ch4",
   "start": 445.725,
   "end": 452.745,
   "text": "The Royal Capital. Banners, towers, ten thousand voices. Every hopeful in the kingdom, packed into one arena.",
   "voice_id": "e686ae649ee44f219a108aacba206c1a",
   "role": "NARRATOR",
   "duration_ms": 7020,
   "pause_ms": 291,
   "start_ms": 445725,
   "end_ms": 452745
  },
  {
   "id": "b108",
   "speaker": "NARRATOR",
   "chapter": "ch4",
   "start": 453.036,
   "end": 465.466,
   "text": "And across the field, a man in black, cigarette burning low. Yami Sukehiro. Alive. Asta's breath catches. He remembers losing that man, and now he's standing right there, yawning.",
   "voice_id": "e686ae649ee44f219a108aacba206c1a",
   "role": "NARRATOR",
   "duration_ms": 12430,
   "pause_ms": 326,
   "start_ms": 453036,
   "end_ms": 465466
  },
  {
   "id": "b110",
   "speaker": "YAMI",
   "chapter": "ch4",
   "start": 465.792,
   "end": 468.822,
   "text": "Kid. Why are you looking at me like I died?",
   "voice_id": "98edc3e10cc140fcb008f5730fdcd3ed",
   "role": "YAMI",
   "duration_ms": 3030,
   "pause_ms": 164,
   "start_ms": 465792,
   "end_ms": 468822
  },
  {
   "id": "b111",
   "speaker": "ASTA",
   "chapter": "ch4",
   "start": 468.986,
   "end": 470.901,
   "text": "No reason. Really.",
   "voice_id": "9dabfe7b1fb54a24bded803a7b1ff5b4",
   "role": "ASTA",
   "duration_ms": 1915,
   "pause_ms": 190,
   "start_ms": 468986,
   "end_ms": 470901
  },
  {
   "id": "b112",
   "speaker": "YAMI",
   "chapter": "ch4",
   "start": 471.091,
   "end": 473.526,
   "text": "Stop it. You're creeping me out, kid.",
   "voice_id": "98edc3e10cc140fcb008f5730fdcd3ed",
   "role": "YAMI",
   "duration_ms": 2435,
   "pause_ms": 199,
   "start_ms": 471091,
   "end_ms": 473526
  },
  {
   "id": "b113",
   "speaker": "ASTA",
   "chapter": "ch4",
   "start": 473.725,
   "end": 475.54,
   "text": "Sorry. Long story.",
   "voice_id": "9dabfe7b1fb54a24bded803a7b1ff5b4",
   "role": "ASTA",
   "duration_ms": 1815,
   "pause_ms": 327,
   "start_ms": 473725,
   "end_ms": 475540
  },
  {
   "id": "b114",
   "speaker": "NARRATOR",
   "chapter": "ch4",
   "start": 475.867,
   "end": 482.247,
   "text": "His match lasts one breath. Asta reads the swing, steps inside it, and ends it with one move.",
   "voice_id": "e686ae649ee44f219a108aacba206c1a",
   "role": "NARRATOR",
   "duration_ms": 6380,
   "pause_ms": 269,
   "start_ms": 475867,
   "end_ms": 482247
  },
  {
   "id": "b115",
   "speaker": "YAMI",
   "chapter": "ch4",
   "start": 482.516,
   "end": 485.161,
   "text": "Not bad, brat. Where'd you learn that?",
   "voice_id": "98edc3e10cc140fcb008f5730fdcd3ed",
   "role": "YAMI",
   "duration_ms": 2645,
   "pause_ms": 192,
   "start_ms": 482516,
   "end_ms": 485161
  },
  {
   "id": "b116",
   "speaker": "ASTA",
   "chapter": "ch4",
   "start": 485.353,
   "end": 486.988,
   "text": "A very patient teacher.",
   "voice_id": "9dabfe7b1fb54a24bded803a7b1ff5b4",
   "role": "ASTA",
   "duration_ms": 1635,
   "pause_ms": 203,
   "start_ms": 485353,
   "end_ms": 486988
  },
  {
   "id": "b117",
   "speaker": "YAMI",
   "chapter": "ch4",
   "start": 487.191,
   "end": 490.021,
   "text": "Tch. Whoever he is, he owes me a drink.",
   "voice_id": "98edc3e10cc140fcb008f5730fdcd3ed",
   "role": "YAMI",
   "duration_ms": 2830,
   "pause_ms": 318,
   "start_ms": 487191,
   "end_ms": 490021
  },
  {
   "id": "b118",
   "speaker": "NARRATOR",
   "chapter": "ch4",
   "start": 490.339,
   "end": 496.999,
   "text": "The arena goes silent. Then one hand goes up. Then another. Hands that never went up for him before.",
   "voice_id": "e686ae649ee44f219a108aacba206c1a",
   "role": "NARRATOR",
   "duration_ms": 6660,
   "pause_ms": 624,
   "start_ms": 490339,
   "end_ms": 496999
  },
  {
   "id": "b135",
   "speaker": "NARRATOR",
   "chapter": "ch4",
   "start": 497.623,
   "end": 509.098,
   "text": "Noelle Silva. Last time, her water magic ran wild for months, and Asta watched her become the pride of her house. Today she's at the edge of the field, spilling water over her own boots.",
   "voice_id": "e686ae649ee44f219a108aacba206c1a",
   "role": "NARRATOR",
   "duration_ms": 11475,
   "pause_ms": 328,
   "start_ms": 497623,
   "end_ms": 509098
  },
  {
   "id": "b136",
   "speaker": "NOELLE",
   "chapter": "ch4",
   "start": 509.426,
   "end": 512.821,
   "text": "Eyes off, commoner. My magic is just having a bad day.",
   "voice_id": "24bae5773d51433cba16d275693e058e",
   "role": "NOELLE",
   "duration_ms": 3395,
   "pause_ms": 198,
   "start_ms": 509426,
   "end_ms": 512821
  },
  {
   "id": "b137",
   "speaker": "ASTA",
   "chapter": "ch4",
   "start": 513.019,
   "end": 518.309,
   "text": "It's not a bad day. You're aiming at your family's approval. Aim at something you want to protect.",
   "voice_id": "9dabfe7b1fb54a24bded803a7b1ff5b4",
   "role": "ASTA",
   "duration_ms": 5290,
   "pause_ms": 174,
   "start_ms": 513019,
   "end_ms": 518309
  },
  {
   "id": "b138",
   "speaker": "NOELLE",
   "chapter": "ch4",
   "start": 518.483,
   "end": 521.758,
   "text": "Don't get the wrong idea. I didn't ask a commoner for advice.",
   "voice_id": "24bae5773d51433cba16d275693e058e",
   "role": "NOELLE",
   "duration_ms": 3275,
   "pause_ms": 186,
   "start_ms": 518483,
   "end_ms": 521758
  },
  {
   "id": "b139",
   "speaker": "NARRATOR",
   "chapter": "ch4",
   "start": 521.944,
   "end": 533.524,
   "text": "But her fingers close anyway. She thinks of nothing she has to win, only of what she'd stand in front of. And the water rises in her bare palm. No wand. Round, and perfectly still.",
   "voice_id": "e686ae649ee44f219a108aacba206c1a",
   "role": "NARRATOR",
   "duration_ms": 11580,
   "pause_ms": 318,
   "start_ms": 521944,
   "end_ms": 533524
  },
  {
   "id": "b140",
   "speaker": "NOELLE",
   "chapter": "ch4",
   "start": 533.842,
   "end": 536.987,
   "text": "It's holding. It's actually holding. It's listening to me.",
   "voice_id": "24bae5773d51433cba16d275693e058e",
   "role": "NOELLE",
   "duration_ms": 3145,
   "pause_ms": 611,
   "start_ms": 533842,
   "end_ms": 536987
  },
  {
   "id": "b141",
   "speaker": "ASTA",
   "chapter": "ch4",
   "start": 537.598,
   "end": 539.773,
   "text": "Yeah. That one's all yours.",
   "voice_id": "9dabfe7b1fb54a24bded803a7b1ff5b4",
   "role": "ASTA",
   "duration_ms": 2175,
   "pause_ms": 281,
   "start_ms": 537598,
   "end_ms": 539773
  },
  {
   "id": "b119",
   "speaker": "YAMI",
   "chapter": "ch4",
   "start": 540.054,
   "end": 543.224,
   "text": "Listen, brat. The Black Bulls aren't exactly—",
   "voice_id": "98edc3e10cc140fcb008f5730fdcd3ed",
   "role": "YAMI",
   "duration_ms": 3170,
   "pause_ms": 160,
   "start_ms": 540054,
   "end_ms": 543224
  },
  {
   "id": "b120",
   "speaker": "ASTA",
   "chapter": "ch4",
   "start": 543.384,
   "end": 546.334,
   "text": "Black Bulls. I'm in. Sign me up.",
   "voice_id": "9dabfe7b1fb54a24bded803a7b1ff5b4",
   "role": "ASTA",
   "duration_ms": 2950,
   "pause_ms": 315,
   "start_ms": 543384,
   "end_ms": 546334
  },
  {
   "id": "b121",
   "speaker": "NARRATOR",
   "chapter": "ch4",
   "start": 546.649,
   "end": 554.744,
   "text": "Across the arena, Yuno signs with the Golden Dawn. His wind moves before he breathes in. That's what years of chasing one boy will do.",
   "voice_id": "e686ae649ee44f219a108aacba206c1a",
   "role": "NARRATOR",
   "duration_ms": 8095,
   "pause_ms": 303,
   "start_ms": 546649,
   "end_ms": 554744
  },
  {
   "id": "b122",
   "speaker": "YUNO",
   "chapter": "ch4",
   "start": 555.047,
   "end": 556.507,
   "text": "Don't fall behind, Asta.",
   "voice_id": "b24024afe64444dda6bc35b086ddd7ca",
   "role": "YUNO",
   "duration_ms": 1460,
   "pause_ms": 202,
   "start_ms": 555047,
   "end_ms": 556507
  },
  {
   "id": "b123",
   "speaker": "ASTA",
   "chapter": "ch4",
   "start": 556.709,
   "end": 557.974,
   "text": "Don't trip, Yuno.",
   "voice_id": "9dabfe7b1fb54a24bded803a7b1ff5b4",
   "role": "ASTA",
   "duration_ms": 1265,
   "pause_ms": 287,
   "start_ms": 556709,
   "end_ms": 557974
  },
  {
   "id": "b124",
   "speaker": "NARRATOR",
   "chapter": "ch4",
   "start": 558.261,
   "end": 563.966,
   "text": "On the arena floor, Asta closes his eyes. The captains' box becomes a map of heartbeats.",
   "voice_id": "e686ae649ee44f219a108aacba206c1a",
   "role": "NARRATOR",
   "duration_ms": 5705,
   "pause_ms": 335,
   "start_ms": 558261,
   "end_ms": 563966
  },
  {
   "id": "b125",
   "speaker": "NARRATOR",
   "chapter": "ch4",
   "start": 564.301,
   "end": 572.051,
   "text": "He knows exactly where to look. William Vangeance sits very still, and inside him there are two Ki. Two lives. One body.",
   "voice_id": "e686ae649ee44f219a108aacba206c1a",
   "role": "NARRATOR",
   "duration_ms": 7750,
   "pause_ms": 264,
   "start_ms": 564301,
   "end_ms": 572051
  },
  {
   "id": "b126",
   "speaker": "NARRATOR",
   "chapter": "ch4",
   "start": 572.315,
   "end": 580.525,
   "text": "But this time, someone feels it back. Behind William's calm eyes, Patolli turns, slow as a blade, toward the boy who is looking.",
   "voice_id": "e686ae649ee44f219a108aacba206c1a",
   "role": "NARRATOR",
   "duration_ms": 8210,
   "pause_ms": 601,
   "start_ms": 572315,
   "end_ms": 580525
  },
  {
   "id": "b127",
   "speaker": "NARRATOR",
   "chapter": "ch4",
   "start": 581.126,
   "end": 586.476,
   "text": "Above them all, Wizard King Julius Novachrono tilts his head. He's watching the boy.",
   "voice_id": "e686ae649ee44f219a108aacba206c1a",
   "role": "NARRATOR",
   "duration_ms": 5350,
   "pause_ms": 314,
   "start_ms": 581126,
   "end_ms": 586476
  },
  {
   "id": "b128",
   "speaker": "JULIUS",
   "chapter": "ch4",
   "start": 586.79,
   "end": 592.06,
   "text": "Oh? This boy's time doesn't move like ours. Someone has wound it back. How interesting.",
   "voice_id": "c1cdbad44d024567a2c92e519fbf481a",
   "role": "JULIUS",
   "duration_ms": 5270,
   "pause_ms": 573,
   "start_ms": 586790,
   "end_ms": 592060
  },
  {
   "id": "b142",
   "speaker": "NARRATOR",
   "chapter": "ch4",
   "start": 592.633,
   "end": 605.153,
   "text": "That night, on the road to the Black Bulls' hideout, the air above the trees folds open like torn cloth. White-robed mages step out, one after another. The Eye of the Midnight Sun. Months early.",
   "voice_id": "e686ae649ee44f219a108aacba206c1a",
   "role": "NARRATOR",
   "duration_ms": 12520,
   "pause_ms": 316,
   "start_ms": 592633,
   "end_ms": 605153
  },
  {
   "id": "b143",
   "speaker": "NARRATOR",
   "chapter": "ch4",
   "start": 605.469,
   "end": 612.199,
   "text": "None of this happened in his first life. Asta stops walking. The future he memorized has just stopped being true.",
   "voice_id": "e686ae649ee44f219a108aacba206c1a",
   "role": "NARRATOR",
   "duration_ms": 6730,
   "pause_ms": 750,
   "start_ms": 605469,
   "end_ms": 612199
  },
  {
   "id": "b133",
   "speaker": "NARRATOR",
   "chapter": "ch4",
   "start": 612.949,
   "end": 618.564,
   "text": "In Part Two, the Eye of the Midnight Sun comes for the one boy who knows exactly how this story ends.",
   "voice_id": "e686ae649ee44f219a108aacba206c1a",
   "role": "NARRATOR",
   "duration_ms": 5615,
   "pause_ms": 291,
   "start_ms": 612949,
   "end_ms": 618564
  },
  {
   "id": "b134",
   "speaker": "ASTA",
   "chapter": "ch4",
   "start": 618.855,
   "end": 623.225,
   "text": "Wind's changed. Fine. Then I'll learn to read it all over again.",
   "voice_id": "9dabfe7b1fb54a24bded803a7b1ff5b4",
   "role": "ASTA",
   "duration_ms": 4370,
   "pause_ms": 268,
   "start_ms": 618855,
   "end_ms": 623225
  }
 ],
